      "message": "I\u0027m not sure what the value of this class is.  Is this needed or is BaseTransform sufficient?\n\nIs this meant to be an abstract base class?  I\u0027m not sure why you need this class as a hack. It seems as if BaseTransform is what you\u0027ll need or this should be named\n\n\u0027BaseTransform\u0027 and be an abstract base class (ABCMeta) and provide a template that all other transforms must define to be used.",
